LETTER15 = (
  "[bold italic]Thus says The Lord:[/] How is it you have not recognized that which comes from The Father? For that which is of the devil is made plain "
  "and surrounds you on every side. Therefore the things of God become that much more precious, even as you, My son, are most precious in My sight... "
  "[italic]Like a gemstone shining in the midst of all this darkness, easily found by the eyes of God, so shall you be in the day you surrender your life, "
  "the day you give up this fight and return to Me.[/] Do you not understand that I have saved you? No, not by your own works, but by My life, which I "
  "willingly gave up for you. Therefore, turn to Me wholly and in truth.")
